Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.70,0:22:27.62,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Everything melts into the dead of the night
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.70,0:22:27.62,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}萬物消融於夜的死寂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.62,0:22:33.00,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}As if even gravity fades away
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.62,0:22:33.00,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}彷彿連引力也漸漸消失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:39.17,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Enchanted by the smile like a spark
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.67,0:22:39.17,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}那火花般閃耀的笑容令我如此著迷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:43.64,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}寂しい　忘れちゃう夜だ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.17,0:22:43.64,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}多麼寂寞  終將被忘卻的夜晚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:52.10,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}くだらなく愛おしい話を聞かせて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.01,0:22:52.10,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}再讓我聽聽那無聊卻又惹人憐愛的話語吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:22:58.78,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Dance with me　二人で無限の闇は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.81,0:22:58.78,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}與我共舞  我們在這無邊的黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.78,0:23:01.61,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}重ねた手のひら
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.78,0:23:01.61,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}重疊交織的手掌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.15,0:23:04.61,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}きゅっと結んで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.15,0:23:04.61,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}緊扣在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:10.83,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}ぼやけた視界に映ったものは
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.61,0:23:10.83,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}模糊的視野中映出的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.83,0:23:16.83,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}悲しいくらいに美しいんだね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.83,0:23:16.83,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}美得令人心生悲憐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:20.92,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}彼方明けゆく空
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.83,0:23:20.92,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}遠方的天邊黎明將至
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:25.39,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}目を逸らすんだ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.76,0:23:25.39,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}我的視線也漸漸飄散
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:38.52,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Stay in night
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.72,0:23:38.52,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}只願留在此夜
